#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/detail.html:44
msgid "Group profiles"
msgstr "Gruppenprofile"

#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/detail.html:47
msgid ""
"Each button ticks a profile's permissions as well; Save keeps them. The "
"group doesn't remember the profile."
msgstr ""
"Jede Schaltfläche kreuzt die Berechtigungen eines Profils zusätzlich an; "
"Speichern übernimmt sie. Die Gruppe merkt sich das Profil nicht."

#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/detail.html:52
#, python-format
msgid "Tick the permissions of “%(profile)s”"
msgstr "Berechtigungen von “%(profile)s” ankreuzen"

#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/includes/_form_fields.html:30
#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/index.html:30
msgid "Permissions"
msgstr "Berechtigungen"

#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/includes/_form_fields.html:34
msgid "Add, change and delete include view: saving ticks it."
msgstr ""
"Hinzufügen, Ändern und Löschen schließen Ansehen ein: Speichern kreuzt es an."

#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/includes/_form_fields.html:67
#, python-format
msgid "%(counter)s other permission"
msgid_plural "%(counter)s other permissions"
msgstr[0] "%(counter)s weitere Berechtigung"
msgstr[1] "%(counter)s weitere Berechtigungen"

#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/includes/_form_fields.html:69
msgid ""
"The group also has these. No page of DLCDB checks them, only the Django "
"admin may; saving keeps them."
msgstr ""
"Die Gruppe hat auch diese. Keine Seite der DLCDB prüft sie, höchstens der "
"Django-Admin; Speichern behält sie."

#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/includes/_form_fields.html:87
#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/includes/_ldap_badge.html:5
msgid "LDAP sets the members of this group at each login."
msgstr "LDAP setzt die Mitglieder dieser Gruppe bei jedem Login."

#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/includes/_form_fields.html:89
msgid "You may view the members but do not have permission to change them."
msgstr "Sie dürfen die Mitglieder ansehen, aber nicht ändern."

#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/includes/_form_fields.html:91
msgid ""
"Superusers, too, see devices only through their groups: add yourself to see "
"the devices of its tenants."
msgstr ""
"Auch Superuser sehen Geräte nur über ihre Gruppen: Nehmen Sie sich auf, um "
"die Geräte ihrer Mandanten zu sehen."

#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/includes/_form_fields.html:95
msgid "Active users only; deactivated members stay members."
msgstr "Nur aktive Benutzer; deaktivierte Mitglieder bleiben Mitglieder."

