msgstr "Mitglieder sehen die Geräte dieser Mandanten."

#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/includes/_form_fields.html:124
msgid "No tenants yet."
msgstr "Noch keine Mandanten."

#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/includes/_form_fields.html:131
#: dlcdb/tenants/templates/tenants/index.html:23 dlcdb/tenants/views.py:104
msgid "Add tenant"
msgstr "Mandant hinzufügen"

#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/includes/_form_fields.html:139
msgid "Members see no devices through this group."
msgstr "Mitglieder sehen über diese Gruppe keine Geräte."

#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/includes/_form_fields.html:143
#: dlcdb/tenants/templates/tenants/index.html:36
msgid ""
"Permissions are not per tenant: what users may do through any of their "
"groups applies in every tenant they can access."
msgstr ""
"Berechtigungen gelten nicht pro Mandant: Was Benutzer über eine ihrer "
"Gruppen dürfen, gilt in jedem Mandanten, auf den sie Zugriff haben."

#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/index.html:6
