#: dlcdb/tenants/admin.py:68
msgid "Groups"
msgstr "Gruppen"

#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/index.html:21
msgid ""
"A group's permissions decide what its members may do; its tenants decide "
"whose devices they see."
msgstr ""
"Die Berechtigungen einer Gruppe bestimmen, was ihre Mitglieder dürfen, ihre "
"Mandanten, wessen Geräte sie sehen."

#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/index.html:31
#: dlcdb/tenants/templates/tenants/index.html:87
#: dlcdb/tenants/templates/tenants/index.html:97
msgid "Active user accounts; with LDAP as of each user's last login"
msgstr ""
"Aktive Benutzerkonten; bei LDAP mit Stand der jeweils letzten Anmeldung"

#: dlcdb/accounts/templates/accounts/groups/index.html:60
